---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Awards & Accreditations"
description: "Abatec's industry awards and professional accreditations, including REC membership and Constructionline Gold status."
---
<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">Home</a> / About Us / Awards &amp; Accreditations</p>
    <span class="eyebrow">About Us</span>
    <h1>Recognition we've earned, not claimed.</h1>
    <p>From industry body membership to national recruitment awards, our accreditations are the compliance backbone that lets tier-one contractors and growing SMEs trust us with their critical hires.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Accreditations</span>
      <h2>Compliance, verified.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--4">
      {% for a in site.accreditations %}
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card__icon">✓</div>
        <h3>{{ a.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ a.description }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section--slate">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Awards</span>
      <h2>Recognised across the industry</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>South West Recruitment Agency of the Year</h3>
        <p>Regional Recruitment Industry Awards, 2023 &amp; 2021</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Best Engineering &amp; Construction Recruiter</h3>
        <p>UK Recruiter Awards, 2022</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Excellence in Candidate Care</h3>
        <p>REC Industry Awards, 2020</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Diversity &amp; Inclusion Commendation</h3>
        <p>Disability Confident Employer Network, 2020</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Fastest-Growing Independent Recruiter</h3>
        <p>South West Business Insider, 2018</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Agency of the Year — Industrial</h3>
        <p>Regional Recruitment Industry Awards, 2017</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <div>
        <h2>See the delivery behind the awards.</h2>
        <p>Read how we've applied this track record to live client programmes.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ '/for-clients/case-studies/' | url }}">View case studies</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
